<section class="section section-full" data-reveal-group>
  <div class="container-interior" data-reveal>
    <div class="eyebrow primary">Our Services</div>
    <h2>Design-Build Made Simple</h2>
    <p class="sub-desc">One team, one process, from concept to completion.</p>
    <p>
      With our Design-Build services, we handle everything—from the initial concept and 
      design to permits and construction—under one roof. This means fewer delays, better 
      communication, and one team working together to bring your vision to life. 
      It's a faster, more efficient way to build, and it helps keep your project on time 
      and on budget.
    </p>
    <p>
      Our design-build approach streamlines the entire construction process by combining 
      architectural design, engineering, and construction services into a single, unified 
      team. This eliminates the traditional back-and-forth between separate entities and 
      creates a seamless flow from concept to completion.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="container-interior whats-included" data-reveal>
    <h3 data-reveal>What's included</h3>
    <ul class="inluded-list">
      <li data-reveal>Preventive maintenance programs</li>
      <li data-reveal>Emergency repairs and quick response</li>
      <li data-reveal>Painting and touch-ups</li>
      <li data-reveal>Drywall repairs</li>
      <li data-reveal>Flooring repairs and replacement</li>
      <li data-reveal>Tenant turnover preparation</li>
      <li data-reveal>General building upkeep</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-full projects-page box-shadow" data-reveal-group>
  <div class="container-interior" data-reveal>
    <h2 class="sub">Related Design-Build Projects</h2>

    <div class="related-projects-carousel">
      <div class="slideshow-viewport">
        <div class="project-grid slideshow-track">
          {% for project in projects %}
            {% if project.slug in featuredProjectSlugs %}
              <a href="{{ project.url }}" class="project-tile" data-category="{{ project.category | lower | replace(' ', '-') }}">
                <div class="project-tile-placeholder" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                {% if project.image %}
                  <img src="{{ project.image }}" alt="{{ project.title }}" />
                {% endif %}
                <div class="project-tile-overlay">
                  <span class="project-category">{{ project.category }}</span>
                  <h3>{{ project.title }}</h3>
                  <span class="view-project">View Project <span class="arrow">→</span></span>
                </div>
              </a>
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

